E
enormous black pearl eye tranquility~
The pearl now called the Eye of Tranquility was formed in the swift tumult
of a storm.  Millions of oysters were caught up in the tumult, with all of
their pearl forming matter swirling into a vortex at the center of a
massive whirlpool.  The pearl itself was discovered in the throat of a huge
silvery fish, spat free into the hands of humble fisherfolk before the fish
vanished.  They placed it in the hands of their local priestess, who gave
it to her church, which has seen that it stays in the hands of virtue.
~
